EmitInstructionModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Emission of a single IR instruction (via LowerInstr) into the currently open block.
    Provides: EmitInstruction(node, blocks, openIdx) -> blocks.
    DependsOn: LowerInstr (via Include)
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../EmitInstruction/EmitInstruction.sir).
